[{"id":168625878,"discussion_id":"25e3e136b887951b152ff05a7a1e0c0cda9b8a0c","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n⚠️ This PR does not yet meet the following requirements:lgtm (requires ≥ 2 person(s) per module)、approve (requires ≥ 1 person(s) per module)\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ❌ (0/2)(You can also ask: [*shen_weiling*](https://gitcode.com/shen_weiling), [*wenxin_fight*](https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight), [*haijie_699874*](https://gitcode.com/haijie_699874), [*gaoxiang618*](https://gitcode.com/gaoxiang618), [*刘丹*](https://gitcode.com/liudan12)) | ❌ (0/1)(You can also ask: [*黄俊健*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*juyangokok*](https://gitcode.com/juyangokok), [*huangwei791*](https://gitcode.com/huangwei791), [*shen_weiling*](https://gitcode.com/shen_weiling), [*tang-hao-hw-gitcode*](https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode)) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n qq_45930774, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-17T10:54:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-25T17:38:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168626042,"discussion_id":"6ba5e6cb9bb61d97b83a747dea0232c619487a87","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要对Flash Attention算子进行了两处代码重构与优化。第一，优化了推理场景下查询（Query）张量从全局内存到本地内存（L1）的数据搬运逻辑，移除了针对特定数据布局和`GS1`维度合并场景的特殊处理分支，旨在统一数据拷贝路径，简化代码结构。第二，优化了KV Cache的处理逻辑，移除了对`isGqa`标志位的冗余条件判断，简化了`AdjustActualS1Size`和`ComputeS2LoopInfo`两个核心函数的实现，解决了代码中的不必要分支和逻辑重复问题，提升了代码的可读性和维护性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改主要涉及两个部分。首先，在`IterateBmm1Nd`函数中，针对推理模式下的查询张量加载逻辑进行了重构，删除了原先依赖`IsGS1Merge`条件的复杂分支，统一为根据`layout`模板参数选择对应的全局内存偏移计算方式，并调用通用的`CopyToL1Nd2Nz`函数完成数据搬运。其次，在`infer_flash_attention_kvcache.h`文件中，将`AdjustActualS1Size`函数内的`enableKVPrefix`判断提升至最外层并移除了`isGqa`分支，同时在`ComputeS2LoopInfo`函数中删除了`isGqa`为真时的特殊处理分支，统一了S2循环索引的计算逻辑。这些改动均未改变算子核心功能，属于内部实现的重构与简化。","created_at":"2026-04-17T10:55:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T10:55:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":169497315,"discussion_id":"2d7a46476da0603099ef5d73b1039d3b66b2da75","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-04-25T10:35:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-25T10:35:19+08:00","user":{"id":"689359de5e31a8521e9bb8f0","login":"qq_45930774","object_id":"689359de5e31a8521e9bb8f0","name":"PHOEVER","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fd/fb/5f08df3bc8e33548d23064e9a26f604752babba7a663ec776d83c9e09937d0e2.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/qq_45930774"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":169497593,"discussion_id":"01fa06db447b200f0291822eba6c5b44d1d8fd49","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=936ada3e